stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Unlinked: new media file
  Unlinked --> Linked: link
  Linked --> Linked: re-run (ok, same inode)
  Linked --> Stale: source replaced (new inode)
  Stale --> Linked: relink (atomic)
  Linked --> Orphan: source deleted
  Orphan --> [*]: prune (only with --prune)
  Linked --> [*]: undo PLAN
